<title>POLAND: BRE TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 100.</title>
<headline>BRE TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 100.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 640,000 shares in Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA (BRE) at 100 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, BRE was trading at 105 zlotys in 38.230 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
